### overview localstack
GET http://localhost:4566/_localstack/health

### publish happy-path event
POST http://localhost:3000/producer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "tx-happy-001",
  "email": "paulo.rios@grupoboticario.com.br",
  "order": 1
}

### publish duplicate event (same transactionId)
POST http://localhost:3000/producer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "tx-happy-001",
  "email": "paulo.rios@grupoboticario.com.br",
  "order": 2
}

### publish transient failure event (retry expected)
POST http://localhost:3000/producer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "tx-transient-001",
  "email": "retry@example.com",
  "forceTransientError": true
}

### publish permanent failure event (send to final DLQ)
POST http://localhost:3000/producer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "tx-permanent-001",
  "invalid": true
}